{
    "version": "1.2.0",
    "description": "Aurora AI 智能助手——单机部署的浏览器 Web UI 智能助手（FastAPI + Vue3）",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/plxlaaa/aurora",
    "license": "MIT",
    "repository": {
        "type": "git",
        "url": "https://github.com/plxlaaa/aurora.git"
    },
    "notes": [
        "Aurora AI 智能助手：多轮对话、视觉理解、上下文压缩、Skills / MCP / 自定义工具。",
        "安装后在 %ProgramData%\\Aurora 生成配置与会话数据，卸载时默认保留。",
        "如需注册开机自启服务，安装后执行：",
        "  powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File %ProgramData%\\Aurora\\..\\..\\install.ps1 -RegisterService",
        "更推荐直接克隆仓库执行：",
        "  powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File deploy\\windows\\install.ps1 -RegisterService"
    ],
    "bin": [
        "aurora"
    ],
    "checkver": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/plxlaaa/aurora/releases/latest",
        "regex": "\"tag_name\":\\s*\"v(?<version>[\\d.]+)\""
    },
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/plxlaaa/aurora/releases/latest"
    }
}
